---

Technical feasibility review for epic {{.id}}: "{{.title}}".

Compare research findings against the epic PRD from a technical perspective.

READ:
(1) All 6 epic PRD files at {{.file_path}} (epic.md, personas.md, user-journeys.md, requirements.md, success-metrics.md, scope.md)
(2) Research report from the research phase
(3) BA feasibility review report
(4) Other epic architectures and PRDs under docs/plan/ for system-wide awareness

EVALUATE:
(1) Technical feasibility -- can each requirement area be implemented with available technology and team capabilities?
(2) Architectural concerns -- does research reveal integration complexity, performance risks, or scaling issues?
(3) Dependency and integration risks -- are there external system dependencies or cross-epic technical conflicts?
(4) Technical debt implications -- will this epic create or exacerbate technical debt?
(5) Technical Feasibility Score -- based off of the previous evaluations, provide a score from 0-100 where 100 is clear with no blockers or concerns.

PRODUCE: Technical feasibility review report with findings for each area, overall assessment (APPROVED or CONCERNS_FOUND), and recommended actions.

IF APPROVED: Advance via shark epic update {{.id}} --status=ready_for_tech_check.

IF CONCERNS FOUND: Set intervention_required via shark epic update {{.id}} --status=intervention_required, and write a structured intervention report detailing what's wrong, options, and recommended action.
